4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[15px] font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 min-[360px]:text-base sm:text-2xl\">GreenEngineering<span class=\"text-emerald-600\">LCA</span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-5 lg:flex xl:gap-6\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/\">The Engine</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Estimator</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/guides\">Guides</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md transition-colors hover:bg-slate-800\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Launch Workspace</a></div><div class=\"lg:hidden shrink-0\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-navigation-panel\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-emerald-700 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></header><main class=\"w-full min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-clip\"><main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-gray-800\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-green-700 mb-6\">Privacy Policy</h1><p class=\"mb-4\"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> August 29, 2026</p><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">1. Introduction</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">Welcome to Green Engineering Tools (&quot;GET&quot;), operating at greenengineeringtools.com and solar.greenengineeringtools.com. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our SaaS applications, including the Embodied Carbon LCA and the Smart Solar Load Calculator.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">2. Information We Collect</h2><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2\"><li><strong>Provided Data:</strong> Data you input into our calculators (e.g., appliance loads, building materials, Revit structural data). This data is processed to generate your reports.</li><li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> We may collect non-identifiable information such as IP addresses, browser types, and usage patterns via Google Analytics to improve our tools.</li></ul></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">3. Third-Party Services &amp; Google AdSense</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">We use third-party services to operate and monetize our platform:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2\"><li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user&#x27;s prior visits to this website or other websites. Google&#x27;s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your browsing history. You may opt-out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href=\"https://www.google.com/settings/ads\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline\">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li><li><strong>External APIs:</strong> Our LCA tool connects to the EC3 API to retrieve environmental product data.</li><li><strong>Database Hosting:</strong> Application data is securely processed and stored using Neon (Serverless PostgreSQL) and Cloudflare edge infrastructure.</li></ul></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">4. Contact Information</h2><p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact:<br/><strong>Engr. Arsalan Khan</strong><br/>Mardan, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan<br/>Email: [Insert Your Email Here]</p></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto w-full border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-slate-400\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 text-center sm:grid-cols-2 sm:text-left lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"mr-2 h-7 w-7 shrink-0 text-emerald-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-black tracking-tight text-white\">GreenEngineering Tools</span></a><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400 sm:mx-0\">Browser-based tools and practical guides for embodied carbon, EPD data, BIM material workflows and whole-building life-cycle assessment.</p><a class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Open LCA calculator →</a></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Tools</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer tools navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">LCA Engine</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Estimator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator/actual-data\">Actual / Complex Goods</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator/electricity\">CBAM Electricity</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator/bulk\">Official Bulk CSV</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Learn</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer learning navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/embodied-carbon-calculator\">Embodied Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/a1-a3-embodied-carbon\">A1-A3 Embodied Carbon</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/epd-carbon-calculator\">EPD Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/ec3-epd-guide\">EC3 EPD Guide</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">More Guides</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer additional guides\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/bim-embodied-carbon\">BIM Embodied Carbon</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/whole-building-lca\">Whole-Building LCA</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/module-d-lca\">Module D Explained</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/leed-whole-building-lca\">LEED Whole-Building LCA</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Company</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer company navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/terms-of-service\">Terms of Service</a></nav></div></div><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-800 pt-7 md:flex-row\"><p class=\"text-center text-xs text-slate-500 md:text-left\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Green Engineering Tools. All rights reserved.</p><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-center text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500 md:text-right\">Engineering decision-support tools for EN 15804-aligned lifecycle analysis and LEED whole-building LCA workflows. Formal certification and compliance remain subject to project-specific requirements and independent review.</p></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[89759,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nd:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3o28tqlubhbda.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.2bn3s6zvc0dyp.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\nb:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"privacy-policy\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"privacy-policy\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3o28tqlubhbda.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-0\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\